  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "Ｚパワーの　けっしょう。\nジャラランガの　スケイルノイズを\nＺワザに　グレードアップする。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Z파워의 결정.\n짜랑고우거의 스케일노이즈를\nZ기술로 업그레이드한다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ｚ力量的結晶。\n可將杖尾鱗甲龍的鱗片噪音\n升級為Ｚ招式。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une cristallisation de la Force Z, permettant\nde transformer la capacité Vibrécaille d’un Ékaïser\nen capacité Z.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Kristall, dem Z-Kraft innewohnt.\nEr stuft Grandiras’ Attacke Schuppenrasseln\nzu einer Z-Attacke auf.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cristal que confiere el Poder Z al movimiento\nFragor Escamas de Kommo-o.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cristallo in cui è immagazzinato il Potere Z.\nConsente di trasformare la mossa Clamorsquame\ndi Kommo-o in una mossa Z.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This is a crystallized form of Z-Power.\nIt upgrades Kommo-o’s Clanging Scales to\na Z-Move.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
